# J2r: the TP2 reference for J2 - the same image on the pair, general, the same agreement prompts
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): reset 3-12 min; smoke 25-50 min (engine build 10-20 min, cached), agreement 5-10 min: about 45-75 min.
# Also proves the TP4 image leaves the pair unchanged: general boots as before and serves.
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-1
C2_PROFILE=general
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,tool_call,stream_dropped,agreement
